WEBVTT

01:50.520 --> 01:51.400
Miss.

01:52.520 --> 01:53.680
Tong'er.

01:57.920 --> 01:58.880
Why are you here?

01:59.360 --> 02:00.640
The person who brought me here

02:00.720 --> 02:02.920
told me that Duke Su asked me
to take care of you here.

02:03.000 --> 02:04.160
How are you doing, miss?

02:04.240 --> 02:05.920
Did Duke Su make things difficult for you?

02:06.000 --> 02:08.320
I'm fine. All is well.

02:08.400 --> 02:10.199
Miss, when I arrived just now,

02:10.280 --> 02:11.800
I heard someone outside saying

02:11.880 --> 02:14.000
that the Jiang family is going
to welcome Ms. Jiang Li.

02:14.080 --> 02:15.400
Does it mean that we can go home?

02:17.360 --> 02:18.280
Tong'er.

02:18.760 --> 02:21.080
There's something I have to tell you.

02:22.240 --> 02:23.720
I can't do anything

02:24.320 --> 02:26.240
against those who killed Jiang Li now.

02:27.320 --> 02:28.600
I wonder if Li'er would resent me

02:29.680 --> 02:31.160
if she knew.

02:32.720 --> 02:33.560
She wouldn't.

02:34.760 --> 02:36.040
Those who killed her ladyship

02:36.120 --> 02:37.920
are the Jiang family members
who abandoned her.

02:39.520 --> 02:43.200
Returning to the Jiang family
is like going into a tiger's den.

02:44.840 --> 02:46.760
If they find out
I'm pretending to be Jiang Li,

02:47.240 --> 02:49.720
both of us might be killed.

02:51.040 --> 02:52.160
Tong'er.

02:52.240 --> 02:54.560
You've suffered enough
at Zhennv Hall for so many years.

02:55.520 --> 02:56.720
Now, you have the chance

02:57.280 --> 02:58.400
not to go with me.

02:59.440 --> 03:02.400
The world is big.
You can choose your own path.

03:02.480 --> 03:04.640
You don't have to risk your life
to go back with me.

03:06.000 --> 03:06.840
Tong'er.

03:08.160 --> 03:09.080
Miss.

03:09.160 --> 03:11.520
If Madam Ye didn't take me in
as her ladyship's maid,

03:11.600 --> 03:13.200
I would've been sold to a brothel.

03:13.880 --> 03:16.640
I swore that I would protect
her ladyship with my life.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.960
But I couldn't keep my promise.

03:19.040 --> 03:20.720
If I don't do anything for her,

03:20.800 --> 03:23.040
I'll be ashamed to face her
in the afterlife.

03:23.880 --> 03:25.720
As long as we can clear
her ladyship's name,

03:25.800 --> 03:27.440
you'll be my master from now on.

03:27.920 --> 03:29.760
I will serve you forever.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.040
I'll do anything.

03:38.800 --> 03:39.720
All right.

03:41.280 --> 03:44.560
From now on, we'll go through
thick and thin together.

03:53.520 --> 03:54.600
Madam.

03:54.680 --> 03:57.200
Are you really going
to take that girl back?

03:57.280 --> 03:58.920
It wasn't easy to send her away.

03:59.000 --> 04:01.440
If you bring her back…

04:01.520 --> 04:02.520
What do you know?

04:03.800 --> 04:05.640
Although His Majesty
didn't say it outright,

04:05.720 --> 04:07.760
to my husband,

04:07.840 --> 04:09.680
it's like an imperial decree.

04:10.400 --> 04:13.880
We have to bring Jiang Li back.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.400
It's fine to bring her back.

04:16.079 --> 04:17.320
But what was Duke Su thinking?

04:17.399 --> 04:19.800
Why welcome her with the Duke Mansion's
ceremonial weapons?

04:19.880 --> 04:21.560
Won't that give her even more prestige?

04:22.200 --> 04:24.240
These clothes are made
with high-quality fabric.

04:24.320 --> 04:26.360
When you pick up Jiang Li tomorrow,

04:26.440 --> 04:27.360
bring these to her.

04:27.440 --> 04:28.520
At this point,

04:29.320 --> 04:31.480
why must we still give her
such high-quality clothes?

04:31.560 --> 04:33.600
This would flatter her more.

04:33.680 --> 04:35.720
It won't be easy
to control her in the future.

04:36.440 --> 04:37.920
With the carriages of the Jiang family

04:38.000 --> 04:39.720
and the Duke Mansion's ceremonial weapons,

04:39.800 --> 04:41.680
she'll live in a bubble of pride.

04:41.760 --> 04:45.080
We need to make the bubble bigger

04:45.160 --> 04:46.400
until it pops.

04:49.480 --> 04:52.160
There's something
that I'm a bit concerned about.

04:52.720 --> 04:56.520
It may just be a coincidence
that Duke Su is involved in this.

04:57.560 --> 05:00.520
But Mrs. Liu is not a fool.

05:00.600 --> 05:02.240
It's not a coincidence

05:02.320 --> 05:04.200
that the incident at Zhennv Hall

05:04.280 --> 05:07.360
made its way into the imperial court
through the Vice Minister of Revenue.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.240
The only one who knew

05:09.320 --> 05:11.040
about Mrs. Liu
and Ye Zhenzhen's relationship

05:11.120 --> 05:14.560
and could use that
to make this happen is Jiang Li.

05:17.080 --> 05:18.160
All these years,

05:18.840 --> 05:21.080
Old Madam
has never forgotten about that girl.

05:21.920 --> 05:24.560
She keeps thinking and talking about her.

05:25.320 --> 05:27.640
If she's actually that scheming,

05:28.120 --> 05:30.440
and with Old Madam Jiang doting on her,

05:32.360 --> 05:33.200
it'll be

05:33.920 --> 05:34.880
hard for us.

05:36.080 --> 05:37.360
I'll pay attention to that.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.520
DUKE SU'S MANSION

05:57.120 --> 05:58.280
Ms. Sun.

06:00.400 --> 06:01.640
You are…

06:03.640 --> 06:04.520
Jiang Li.

06:15.160 --> 06:16.320
Are you Jiang Li?

06:18.960 --> 06:20.880
Perhaps you can't recognize me

06:20.960 --> 06:22.440
because it has been so many years.

06:24.320 --> 06:26.720
That's not true.
I just haven't seen you in a long time.

06:26.800 --> 06:29.600
Besides, I heard that the Chief
of Zhennv Hall was taken away.

06:29.680 --> 06:32.720
I'm also worried that my eyes
are bleary with age.

06:33.360 --> 06:35.280
So I have to look more carefully.

06:36.240 --> 06:37.080
Here.

06:38.880 --> 06:41.080
This is the hairpin
that my mother left for me.

06:41.640 --> 06:43.200
Look at it carefully, Ms. Sun.

06:47.160 --> 06:49.520
It seems like not only
are Ms. Sun's eyes bleary,

06:49.600 --> 06:51.800
she also has a poor memory.

06:52.280 --> 06:55.800
If Mother and Father
don't want me to go home,

06:56.600 --> 06:57.680
forget it.

06:58.200 --> 06:59.360
My lady, please wait.

06:59.840 --> 07:00.920
I've spoken out of line.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.200
I should slap my mouth.

07:02.680 --> 07:04.920
It's just that
I haven't seen you in a long time.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.920
Please forgive me, my lady.

07:07.000 --> 07:08.120
Madam Ji

07:08.200 --> 07:09.560
misses you so much

07:09.640 --> 07:11.640
since you've been
at Zhennv Hall for so long.

07:11.720 --> 07:13.520
So she kept urging his lordship

07:13.600 --> 07:15.000
to bring you home.

07:15.080 --> 07:16.960
Finally, not long ago,

07:17.040 --> 07:17.920
his lordship agreed.

07:18.000 --> 07:20.360
And Madam Ji immediately
asked people to clean your room

07:20.440 --> 07:21.800
and sent me

07:21.880 --> 07:23.680
to pick you up personally.

07:24.240 --> 07:25.600
If Madam Ji sees

07:25.680 --> 07:27.560
how beautiful you've become,

07:27.640 --> 07:30.400
she'll be so happy.

07:30.480 --> 07:32.080
I'm really grateful to Mother.

07:32.720 --> 07:34.120
I miss her a lot all these years

07:34.200 --> 07:36.240
when I was at Zhennv Hall too.

07:36.320 --> 07:38.880
I always felt regretful
that I couldn't stay by her side

07:38.960 --> 07:40.960
to take care of her.

07:41.760 --> 07:42.640
But this is great.

07:43.120 --> 07:44.560
I'm finally going home.

07:44.640 --> 07:46.480
I'll surely be filial to her

07:46.560 --> 07:48.240
just like how much she favors me.

07:49.440 --> 07:50.760
That's great.

07:51.880 --> 07:52.760
Bring it forward.

07:54.720 --> 07:55.640
Look.

07:55.720 --> 07:57.360
Madam Ji

07:57.440 --> 07:58.800
especially asked me

07:58.880 --> 08:00.760
to buy these new clothes for you.

08:00.840 --> 08:03.040
She's afraid you won't be
comfortable in your old clothes.

08:03.120 --> 08:04.200
Look.

08:04.280 --> 08:06.000
They're all made from high-quality fabric.

08:06.080 --> 08:08.240
I think you should change into them now,

08:08.320 --> 08:11.080
so that you'll look grand when you go home

08:11.160 --> 08:14.080
and show your status.

08:14.720 --> 08:15.880
Thank you, Ms. Sun.

08:16.480 --> 08:17.320
Tong'er.

08:18.160 --> 08:19.000
Here you go.

08:23.680 --> 08:25.680
My lady, after you.

08:49.560 --> 08:50.640
Like you said,

08:50.720 --> 08:52.760
Old Madam dotes on Jiang Li the most.

08:53.720 --> 08:55.680
So Ji Shuran knows very well

08:55.760 --> 08:57.840
that Old Madam
is the only one we can rely on.

08:58.320 --> 08:59.840
I'm sure she won't let us

08:59.920 --> 09:01.280
get close to Old Madam easily.

09:02.880 --> 09:04.120
Tong'er.

09:04.200 --> 09:06.360
Do you know what taboos Old Madam has?

09:06.960 --> 09:08.720
I remember Old Master Jiang

09:08.800 --> 09:10.720
once took a woman
from a brothel as his concubine.

09:11.400 --> 09:13.120
That woman was haughty.

09:13.200 --> 09:14.520
She loved luxurious dresses

09:14.600 --> 09:15.840
and brocade was her favorite.

09:15.920 --> 09:17.840
That kind of fabric
is as expensive as gold.

09:18.920 --> 09:20.760
She spent a lot of money,

09:20.840 --> 09:23.000
so Old Madam hated her so much.

09:26.200 --> 09:27.760
MAKE WAY

09:39.320 --> 09:40.160
MR. QIN'S FATHER

09:40.240 --> 09:43.600
Duke Su, you arrested my son

09:44.200 --> 09:45.680
without any valid reason.

09:47.560 --> 09:50.760
You really have no respect for me,

09:50.840 --> 09:52.840
a senior statesman
who has served two reigns.

09:52.920 --> 09:56.000
Trafficking salt is like stealing
from the National Treasury.

09:57.400 --> 09:59.080
I'm investigating
under His Majesty's order.

09:59.760 --> 10:00.840
If he's guilty,

10:00.920 --> 10:02.760
His Majesty will make the final decision.

10:03.840 --> 10:05.000
If he's not guilty,

10:05.080 --> 10:08.360
we can prove once and for all
that he's innocent.

10:08.840 --> 10:10.520
It's too early to say he was arrested

10:11.080 --> 10:12.040
for no valid reason,

10:12.560 --> 10:13.560
Duke Qin.

10:14.280 --> 10:18.240
I'll give you
a few more days then, Duke Su.

10:19.560 --> 10:23.560
If you can't find any evidence
and still refuse to release him,

10:24.160 --> 10:27.360
I'll seek justice for my son even if
I need to sacrifice the life I lived

10:27.440 --> 10:30.440
doing meritorious deeds
serving two reigns.

10:31.240 --> 10:32.520
I believe

10:33.840 --> 10:36.840
that someone as filial as His Majesty

10:37.400 --> 10:41.200
will understand
the love I have for my son.

10:48.720 --> 10:49.560
I won't see you off.

10:57.480 --> 10:59.560
Duke Qin's son still refuses to confess.

11:00.160 --> 11:01.720
Should we torture him?

11:01.800 --> 11:03.720
Mr. Qin knows that his father
will back him up.

11:04.200 --> 11:05.240
Of course he won't confess.

11:05.320 --> 11:07.920
Are you worried I won't get
a confession with my gentle techniques

11:08.440 --> 11:09.520
or that his father

11:09.600 --> 11:10.840
will report this to His Majesty?

11:11.760 --> 11:12.680
In our job,

11:13.160 --> 11:14.360
are we afraid of trouble?

11:14.920 --> 11:15.960
So reckless.

11:17.800 --> 11:19.560
It is Ms. Jiang Li's fault
for tricking us.

11:20.240 --> 11:21.280
At first, I thought that

11:21.360 --> 11:23.360
we could find the mastermind through her.

11:24.000 --> 11:25.600
But now, we are stuck.

11:26.080 --> 11:27.520
This is no fun.

11:30.040 --> 11:34.080
BENEFITTING THE PEOPLE

11:34.160 --> 11:38.080
MAKE WAY

11:44.000 --> 11:45.640
It seems like she's being taken home.

11:45.720 --> 11:47.920
The Duke Mansion's
ceremonial weapons are indeed grand.

11:48.000 --> 11:48.920
MAKE WAY

11:49.000 --> 11:50.040
My lord,

11:50.120 --> 11:53.160
Chancellor Jiang is bringing his daughter
back from the Duke Mansion.

11:53.240 --> 11:55.400
You even gave her
half of your ceremonial weapons.

11:55.480 --> 11:58.120
We haven't found any evidence
but we're watching from here,

11:58.200 --> 11:59.280
is that appropriate?

12:09.280 --> 12:11.600
Look, I didn't expect flowers
to bloom so early this year.

12:11.680 --> 12:12.520
Yes.

12:13.600 --> 12:14.880
Are you going to take them all?

12:14.960 --> 12:17.040
- Don't worry. I have money.
- Let's check out another store.

12:18.600 --> 12:20.480
EARNEST PEOPLE, PROSPEROUS LAND

12:44.840 --> 12:45.760
My lord.

12:45.840 --> 12:47.680
Ms. Jiang Li is quite interesting.

12:47.760 --> 12:49.960
She tricked us
in order to return to the Jiang family.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.800
Now that
she's in the Jiang family's carriage,

12:52.560 --> 12:53.600
she forgot all about you.

13:02.200 --> 13:03.400
What does this mean?

13:04.000 --> 13:05.120
Five canes.

13:05.200 --> 13:06.640
Are you going to flog me again?

13:07.800 --> 13:09.360
If she's the real Jiang Li,

13:10.000 --> 13:13.240
consider that half of my
ceremonial weapons as a gift for her.

13:13.800 --> 13:15.240
Are you saying that…

13:15.320 --> 13:16.840
Her identity is suspicious.

13:17.440 --> 13:19.200
And it involves an important official.

13:19.280 --> 13:20.720
I need to be thorough.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.000
Tell me.

13:23.480 --> 13:24.880
Why would a troublesome person

13:24.960 --> 13:26.680
want to enter

13:26.760 --> 13:27.880
a troublesome place?

13:29.120 --> 13:30.600
I don't believe in coincidence,

13:30.680 --> 13:32.680
regardless of looks

13:33.360 --> 13:34.480
or other things.

13:34.560 --> 13:36.240
But she's back in the Jiang family now,

13:36.320 --> 13:38.360
it'll be even harder
to interrogate her after this.

13:39.200 --> 13:40.720
We don't have to interrogate her.

13:41.280 --> 13:44.480
It's better to let her go home
and see what she's going to do.

13:45.000 --> 13:46.680
- Watch her closely.
- Yes.

14:08.200 --> 14:09.560
What are you doing, dear?

14:10.880 --> 14:13.080
Mother reminded me yesterday.

14:13.560 --> 14:14.880
I haven't seen her for ten years.

14:14.960 --> 14:17.200
I should prepare a welcome gift for her.

14:17.840 --> 14:20.040
Now, Duke Su is even sending her back

14:20.120 --> 14:21.520
with his ceremonial weapons.

14:21.600 --> 14:23.680
If I don't prepare well,

14:23.760 --> 14:26.920
I'll become a joke to people in this city.

14:28.560 --> 14:31.840
Dear, this is a gift from His Majesty.

14:32.360 --> 14:33.960
What do you think?

14:34.520 --> 14:36.360
You love precious jade.

14:37.000 --> 14:40.120
But Li'er is just a kid.
She won't know much about it.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.680
What about this calligraphy and painting?

14:50.200 --> 14:51.280
It's from a famous artist,

14:51.360 --> 14:52.400
rare and precious.

14:52.480 --> 14:53.840
Have you forgotten?

14:53.920 --> 14:55.280
Li'er grew up at Zhennv Hall

14:55.360 --> 14:56.720
and hasn't been to school much.

14:57.480 --> 14:59.640
She'll be sad
if you give her gifts like these.

15:10.600 --> 15:11.600
Take a rest.

15:19.560 --> 15:21.480
I've overlooked that.

15:21.560 --> 15:23.520
I've already made arrangements.

15:23.600 --> 15:25.680
I already asked someone
to bring her some clothes

15:25.760 --> 15:27.600
made out of high-quality fabric.

15:27.680 --> 15:29.800
Ruoyao likes them,
but I didn't even give them to her.

15:29.880 --> 15:32.120
Li'er will come back beautifully

15:32.200 --> 15:33.360
and respectably.

15:33.440 --> 15:35.600
No one would dare say she's ill-treated
by the Jiang family.

15:42.720 --> 15:44.240
Thank you, dear.

15:47.400 --> 15:48.520
I'll get changed first.

16:11.880 --> 16:12.840
Why isn't she here yet?

16:12.920 --> 16:13.800
Right.

16:13.880 --> 16:16.040
Yes. It has been so many years.

16:16.520 --> 16:19.760
I wonder how Ms. Jiang looks.

16:19.840 --> 16:22.600
How pretty can a wild girl
who lived in the mountains

16:22.680 --> 16:23.800
for so long be?

16:23.880 --> 16:25.560
- That's right.
- Yes.

16:25.640 --> 16:29.000
Welcome Ms. Jiang back
from self-cultivation!

16:29.840 --> 16:30.840
She's here.

16:30.920 --> 16:31.880
MAKE WAY

16:39.200 --> 16:40.200
Start the music!

16:52.480 --> 16:54.160
Is she Ms. Jiang?

16:54.240 --> 16:55.720
See? I knew it.

16:55.800 --> 16:59.400
Ms. Jiang looks so tacky.

16:59.480 --> 17:00.920
- That's right.
- Yes.

17:01.000 --> 17:03.280
The Jiang family is wealthy.

17:03.360 --> 17:05.280
Is this how they treat their own daughter?

17:45.280 --> 17:46.760
Is she Li'er?

17:46.840 --> 17:49.040
JIANG RESIDENCE

17:49.120 --> 17:49.960
Li'er.

17:50.840 --> 17:51.960
YOUNG TONG'ER

18:00.120 --> 18:02.360
As long as you apologize to your mother,

18:03.040 --> 18:05.440
you won't have to go
to the mountain to repent.

18:06.560 --> 18:08.160
I didn't do anything wrong.

18:30.360 --> 18:33.680
Greetings, Father, Mother.

18:42.640 --> 18:43.760
Rise.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.400
Li'er.

18:50.960 --> 18:53.400
Why are you wearing clothes
from Zhennv Hall?

18:59.920 --> 19:02.560
Didn't you bring new clothes to Li'er?

19:02.640 --> 19:03.680
Ms. Sun.

19:03.760 --> 19:06.320
Didn't I ask you
to bring new clothes over?

19:06.400 --> 19:08.880
I brought the clothes very early
to Ms. Jiang.

19:09.360 --> 19:11.960
But when she heard
that they were from you, she…

19:12.040 --> 19:13.680
Maybe she didn't like them.

19:15.760 --> 19:18.680
Li'er, those clothes are a gift
from your mother.

19:19.240 --> 19:20.600
Why didn't you wear them?

19:22.120 --> 19:24.240
Maybe Li'er doesn't like the clothes

19:24.320 --> 19:25.800
that I sent.

19:26.440 --> 19:27.800
She can go shopping tomorrow

19:27.880 --> 19:29.360
and choose some new clothes herself.

19:30.520 --> 19:31.360
Mother.

19:32.760 --> 19:34.480
The clothes you gave me

19:34.560 --> 19:36.120
are made out of high-quality brocade.

19:37.080 --> 19:39.760
I love them and I'm grateful.

19:41.120 --> 19:42.160
But…

19:45.000 --> 19:45.880
But what?

19:46.640 --> 19:48.440
But maybe it has been too long.

19:49.040 --> 19:51.160
Mother has never visited me
at Zhennv Hall,

19:52.040 --> 19:54.720
so she doesn't know my size.

19:54.800 --> 19:57.360
I couldn't fit
into any of the clothes she gave me.

19:59.000 --> 20:00.560
How could you be so careless?

20:00.640 --> 20:02.840
My lord, it's all my fault.

20:02.920 --> 20:04.400
Madam Ji did ask me to find out

20:04.480 --> 20:07.200
Ms. Jiang's size and measurements.

20:07.280 --> 20:08.800
But I overlooked it.

20:08.880 --> 20:10.040
Please punish me.

20:10.920 --> 20:12.320
Don't be mad anymore, dear.

20:12.840 --> 20:14.360
Maybe I'm too happy

20:15.160 --> 20:17.160
that I've forgotten to supervise it.

20:17.720 --> 20:18.840
Li'er, let's come in first.

20:19.400 --> 20:21.160
Don't make your uncles and aunts
wait long.

20:43.960 --> 20:47.080
Li'er, greet your uncles and aunts.

20:53.960 --> 20:55.120
Second Uncle.

20:55.800 --> 20:56.640
Aunt Lu.

21:02.280 --> 21:03.920
Your second uncle, Jiang Yuanping,

21:04.000 --> 21:04.920
is tall

21:05.000 --> 21:06.120
and looks kind.

21:06.200 --> 21:08.280
He's Jiang Yuanbai's legitimate brother.

21:08.360 --> 21:10.600
His wife, Madam Lu, is the daughter
of the Gentleman for Rendering Service.

21:10.680 --> 21:13.080
Jiang Yuanping is famous
for doting on his wife.

21:13.160 --> 21:16.000
Back then, Madam Lu caught a cold
during postnatal care,

21:16.080 --> 21:17.400
resulting in chronic headaches.

21:17.480 --> 21:19.040
He feels really guilty about it.

21:19.640 --> 21:21.760
It's good that you are back.

21:24.080 --> 21:25.600
I don't know what you like.

21:26.160 --> 21:28.840
Please take
this jade bead rosary as a gift.

21:31.120 --> 21:32.240
Thank you, Aunt Lu.

21:32.920 --> 21:33.800
Aunt Lu,

21:34.280 --> 21:37.000
have your headaches gotten better?

21:39.560 --> 21:41.280
My headache is not that severe anymore.

21:41.360 --> 21:43.520
Your second uncle
got many physicians to treat me.

21:44.280 --> 21:46.080
I don't get much headache now.

21:46.160 --> 21:47.840
How kind of you to worry about me.

21:47.920 --> 21:50.120
Li'er has always been very sensible.

21:50.200 --> 21:53.000
I always held her when she was young
and she never cried or threw a fit.

21:53.080 --> 21:55.320
Now, she's already a young lady.

21:59.280 --> 22:01.680
Third Uncle, Aunt Yang.

22:03.080 --> 22:05.760
I've prepared
a pair of pearl earrings for you.

22:08.040 --> 22:09.760
Jiang Yuanxing, the third concubine's son.

22:09.840 --> 22:10.760
He has big eyes.

22:10.840 --> 22:12.000
As the third concubine's son,

22:12.080 --> 22:13.360
he's not valued by the Jiang family.

22:13.440 --> 22:14.640
He loves fishing.

22:15.160 --> 22:17.600
Madam Yang is the Court Gentleman of
Manifest Virtue's illegitimate daughter.

22:17.680 --> 22:19.880
If it wasn't because she was getting old,

22:19.960 --> 22:22.120
she wouldn't marry a teacher
like Jiang Yuanxing.

22:24.280 --> 22:25.440
Do you like them?

22:26.160 --> 22:27.440
Thank you, Aunt Yang.

22:29.720 --> 22:32.480
Third Uncle, do you still go fishing?

22:33.320 --> 22:35.280
When I usually went out to chop firewood,

22:35.360 --> 22:39.280
I saw many lively fishes
in the river of Qingcheng Mountain.

22:39.360 --> 22:40.760
The view was amazing too.

22:41.320 --> 22:43.000
I haven't gone fishing in a long time.

22:45.080 --> 22:47.440
Li'er is such a thoughtful child.

22:47.520 --> 22:48.560
You're right.

22:48.640 --> 22:50.960
She still thinks about us
after so many years.

22:51.040 --> 22:53.080
Yuanbai, since all of us are here today,

22:53.160 --> 22:55.160
let's have a reunion dinner tonight.

22:55.240 --> 22:57.080
We can invite Old Madam too.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.280
Sure.

22:58.360 --> 22:59.840
Li'er has just returned.

22:59.920 --> 23:01.960
I'm sure she's tired from her journey.

23:02.040 --> 23:04.200
We can have dinner tomorrow.

23:04.280 --> 23:06.240
Please be understanding.

23:06.320 --> 23:07.960
Don't make Li'er too tired.

23:09.000 --> 23:10.000
That's good too.

23:15.440 --> 23:17.360
Am I right, Li'er?

23:19.360 --> 23:20.520
As you wish, Mother.

23:23.400 --> 23:25.520
Li'er has really grown up.

23:25.600 --> 23:27.120
You've become more sensible now.

23:27.200 --> 23:29.080
You are so considerate, dear.

23:29.880 --> 23:30.800
Li'er.

23:30.880 --> 23:33.560
Let your mother take you
to the rear courtyard to take some rest.

23:35.520 --> 23:36.480
All right.

23:38.480 --> 23:39.320
Let's go.

23:49.040 --> 23:50.640
How tiring can it be

23:51.920 --> 23:53.360
to have a reunion dinner?

23:58.920 --> 24:00.560
Take a good rest, Li'er.

24:00.640 --> 24:03.240
If you need anything,
you can always come to me.

24:11.960 --> 24:12.800
Li'er.

24:13.480 --> 24:14.320
What's wrong?

24:16.360 --> 24:17.760
I haven't been back in a long time.

24:19.200 --> 24:21.400
Our residence has changed drastically.

24:22.560 --> 24:24.040
I don't quite remember my way.

24:25.000 --> 24:28.760
We've renovated the front
and rear yards these past years.

24:30.120 --> 24:32.520
Come. Let me show you around.

24:41.760 --> 24:43.680
Do you still remember this place?

24:45.760 --> 24:46.760
It has changed.

24:48.040 --> 24:48.880
Father.

24:50.160 --> 24:51.000
Look.

24:52.040 --> 24:53.120
I remember

24:53.760 --> 24:57.040
that I cried in fear
on that decorative rock.

24:57.520 --> 24:59.560
I want my mother!

25:02.560 --> 25:05.920
Mother!

25:07.320 --> 25:08.160
Li'er.

25:08.720 --> 25:09.880
Don't be afraid.

25:10.360 --> 25:11.600
I'm here to save you.

25:12.440 --> 25:13.280
Later on,

25:13.360 --> 25:15.000
you said something

25:15.720 --> 25:17.560
that gave me the courage
to jump down from there.

25:17.640 --> 25:19.680
What did I say?

25:20.360 --> 25:21.760
I forgot.

25:23.960 --> 25:25.120
Back then, you said…

25:25.600 --> 25:26.480
Don't worry.

25:27.320 --> 25:29.600
I will never let you get hurt.

25:32.760 --> 25:35.720
I never thought
that you would remember so many things

25:35.800 --> 25:37.280
from your childhood clearly.

25:46.000 --> 25:46.920
I remember

25:48.360 --> 25:49.920
that our family used to love

25:50.000 --> 25:51.600
sitting there to watch the moon together.

25:52.240 --> 25:54.520
Grandmother loved sitting over there
to watch a performance.

25:55.000 --> 25:56.240
Yes.

25:57.960 --> 26:01.040
By the way, how's Grandmother?

26:02.120 --> 26:03.800
She doted on me the most.

26:03.880 --> 26:05.320
I'm unfilial.

26:05.880 --> 26:08.480
I haven't been able
to take care of you and Grandmother.

26:09.480 --> 26:11.680
Your grandmother has always doted on you.

26:11.760 --> 26:13.600
She won't blame you.

26:14.320 --> 26:16.000
It was my fault for making a mistake.

26:17.080 --> 26:19.240
If you hadn't sent me to Zhennv Hall,

26:20.200 --> 26:21.920
I wouldn't have repented and changed.

26:24.040 --> 26:26.080
Let bygones be bygones.

26:26.160 --> 26:28.120
You're all grown up now.

26:28.200 --> 26:29.760
We need to look forward.

26:30.280 --> 26:33.000
Is Grandmother still mad at me?

26:33.960 --> 26:35.280
Old Madam is a kind lady.

26:35.960 --> 26:37.400
Why would she blame you?

26:37.960 --> 26:40.680
If you want to pay her a visit,
just tell us.

26:40.760 --> 26:42.760
Don't torture yourself
by talking about the past.

26:43.240 --> 26:45.280
You're breaking my heart

26:45.360 --> 26:47.200
by saying those words.

26:48.280 --> 26:50.400
At first, I wanted to let you rest
because I worried

26:50.480 --> 26:52.200
that you would be tired from your journey.

26:52.280 --> 26:54.040
Since you can't wait to see her,

26:54.600 --> 26:55.760
I'll go with you.

27:14.760 --> 27:17.080
Mother, Li'er has returned.

27:19.840 --> 27:21.680
OLD MADAM

27:21.760 --> 27:23.440
Is Li'er really back?

27:24.280 --> 27:26.520
Old Madam was very kind to her ladyship.

27:26.600 --> 27:27.800
Her ladyship got cold easily.

27:27.880 --> 27:29.680
She was down
with fever and cough during winter.

27:30.360 --> 27:32.080
When Old Madam found out,

27:32.160 --> 27:34.040
she'd personally cook pear soup
for her ladyship.

27:37.600 --> 27:38.840
Greetings, Grandmother.

27:44.560 --> 27:46.120
Let me take a good look at you.

27:58.840 --> 27:59.840
Is she really Li'er?

28:01.440 --> 28:03.000
Yes, Mother.

28:05.280 --> 28:06.760
My grandchild.

28:06.840 --> 28:07.960
It has been hard on you.

28:08.760 --> 28:12.080
I've become older and less mobile now.

28:12.160 --> 28:13.680
I could only send you some gifts

28:13.760 --> 28:16.040
on occasions.

28:16.120 --> 28:18.320
But you only had Tong'er with you.

28:18.400 --> 28:21.120
And she's still a child.

28:21.200 --> 28:23.080
I wondered if she had taken good care

28:23.160 --> 28:25.200
of those things I sent you.

28:26.720 --> 28:29.640
If Old Madam really cared about Jiang Li,

28:30.720 --> 28:31.720
did she receive anything

28:32.200 --> 28:33.840
from the Old Madam in the past ten years?

28:36.880 --> 28:37.720
We can't be sure.

28:38.760 --> 28:40.040
Maybe she sent them.

28:40.600 --> 28:41.880
But someone blocked them.

28:43.280 --> 28:44.520
I've been living well,

28:45.720 --> 28:46.920
thanks to your care.

28:47.760 --> 28:48.720
I regret not being able

28:48.800 --> 28:50.680
to see you and take care of you

28:51.480 --> 28:53.280
by your side.

28:53.360 --> 28:54.760
Since you are home now,

28:54.840 --> 28:56.760
let's not talk about it anymore.

28:58.520 --> 29:01.880
If you need anything in the future

29:02.360 --> 29:04.120
or if you want to eat anything,

29:04.200 --> 29:05.480
you can come to me.

29:07.520 --> 29:08.680
Thank you, Grandmother.

29:10.840 --> 29:11.960
Ms. Zhang.

29:12.040 --> 29:13.920
Go and cook some pear soup for Li'er.

29:14.000 --> 29:16.760
I remember she loved it
when she was young.

29:16.840 --> 29:17.680
Yes.

29:18.280 --> 29:20.080
Li'er, come.

29:21.080 --> 29:22.040
Come here.

29:27.280 --> 29:29.520
Come, sit down.

29:36.640 --> 29:37.480
Put this on.

29:38.120 --> 29:39.280
No, Grandmother.

29:40.040 --> 29:41.160
This is too valuable.

29:43.040 --> 29:44.080
Take it.

29:44.160 --> 29:45.560
- Here.
- Grandmother.

29:46.840 --> 29:48.840
I'll make up

29:48.920 --> 29:51.280
for what I've owed you for ten years.

29:52.120 --> 29:55.000
Thank you, Grandmother.

29:56.040 --> 29:58.080
You have lovely hands

29:58.160 --> 29:59.840
and a beautiful face.

30:01.560 --> 30:03.800
She didn't look like this in the past.

30:03.880 --> 30:05.720
She looks so different now.

30:08.040 --> 30:08.880
Young Master.

30:08.960 --> 30:10.880
Grandmother, I want to play.

30:10.960 --> 30:12.680
Little Bingji.

30:12.760 --> 30:13.600
He is…

30:13.680 --> 30:15.040
You're the bad girl

30:15.120 --> 30:17.800
who tried to kill my mother and brother.

30:17.880 --> 30:20.680
- I'll hit you! You're a bad girl!
- Bingji!

30:20.760 --> 30:21.600
- Bad girl!
- Bingji.

30:21.680 --> 30:23.000
Bingji, shut up.

30:23.080 --> 30:24.400
- Well…
- Bingji.

30:25.160 --> 30:26.320
Why did you bring Bingji here?

30:26.400 --> 30:27.800
After waking up from his nap,

30:27.880 --> 30:29.720
he wanted to find his mother.

30:29.800 --> 30:31.880
I couldn't stop him.

30:36.240 --> 30:39.040
When have you given birth
to such a cute young boy, Mother?

30:39.760 --> 30:41.680
You are so beautiful, my sister.

30:45.360 --> 30:46.320
Mother.

30:48.800 --> 30:50.040
I'm not your brother.

30:50.120 --> 30:51.080
You are a murderer.

30:51.160 --> 30:52.160
You killed my brother.

30:52.960 --> 30:54.880
- Nonsense, Bingji.
- Bingji, what nonsense is that?

30:55.600 --> 30:58.080
I don't want
the beautiful sister to be here.

30:58.160 --> 31:00.120
Grandmother, I don't want her here!

31:00.200 --> 31:01.040
Get up.

31:01.120 --> 31:03.160
- I don't want her here.
- Get up.

31:03.240 --> 31:05.520
Grandmother, I don't want her here!

31:05.600 --> 31:07.600
Grandmother, I don't want
the beautiful sister here.

31:07.680 --> 31:09.040
Bingji.

31:10.240 --> 31:11.200
Get up.

31:12.840 --> 31:14.120
He's such a young kid.

31:14.680 --> 31:15.840
- He wouldn't say this
- What's going on?

31:15.920 --> 31:16.960
unless someone taught him.

31:17.040 --> 31:18.920
You're right, Madam.

31:19.000 --> 31:20.240
I've been so busy

31:20.320 --> 31:21.920
preparing Li'er's return

31:22.400 --> 31:24.720
that I've overlooked Bingji's education.

31:25.560 --> 31:26.640
It's my fault.

31:27.120 --> 31:28.040
Maybe Young Master

31:28.120 --> 31:30.480
heard the servants gossiping about it.

31:30.560 --> 31:31.480
Old Madam.

31:31.560 --> 31:33.240
Please punish me.

31:34.440 --> 31:35.560
Bingji is still young.

31:35.640 --> 31:37.720
We just have to teach him
better after this.

31:38.560 --> 31:41.040
Today is Li'er's return.

31:41.120 --> 31:42.720
Let's not punish the servants.

31:46.360 --> 31:47.720
Li'er is back.

31:48.920 --> 31:50.680
She came back grandly outside.

31:50.760 --> 31:51.960
But in the family, it's a mess.

31:52.040 --> 31:53.360
This is unacceptable.

31:54.400 --> 31:56.320
I might sound harsh,

31:56.400 --> 31:58.280
but I'm not blaming the child.

31:58.960 --> 32:00.640
I just wanted to remind you

32:00.720 --> 32:03.040
that be it adults or kids,

32:03.120 --> 32:06.280
they must be educated carefully
so that they won't develop bad habits.

32:06.360 --> 32:07.760
That's the whole point

32:07.840 --> 32:10.880
of this family reunion.

32:10.960 --> 32:11.920
You're right, Mother.

32:12.840 --> 32:15.360
Forget it. You may go.

32:16.680 --> 32:19.840
All right. We'll let you rest.

32:20.320 --> 32:24.440
Ms. Sun, take Li'er back
to her room to rest first.

32:24.520 --> 32:25.840
Yes, my lord.

32:49.880 --> 32:51.120
This is your courtyard, Ms. Jiang Li.

32:53.160 --> 32:54.040
FANGFEI COURTYARD

32:54.120 --> 32:55.720
"Fangfei Courtyard."

32:56.960 --> 32:58.480
This is really fate.

33:06.920 --> 33:09.680
This is the courtyard
where you stayed before.

33:09.760 --> 33:10.960
You still remember it, right?

33:12.360 --> 33:13.400
But it looks

33:13.480 --> 33:15.520
a little bit rundown now.

33:15.600 --> 33:18.080
We didn't dare to touch it

33:18.160 --> 33:19.880
because you weren't here.

33:19.960 --> 33:22.360
I think it'll look nice
once it's cleaned up.

33:22.840 --> 33:25.280
Your return is too sudden.

33:25.360 --> 33:27.280
There were too many things
to do in a short time.

33:27.360 --> 33:30.280
The servants didn't have enough time
to clean the place too.

33:30.360 --> 33:31.280
I think

33:31.360 --> 33:33.920
we'll have to trouble you

33:34.480 --> 33:35.760
to clean up the place yourself.

33:36.880 --> 33:37.880
Then it'll actually be

33:37.960 --> 33:40.120
to your liking, right?

33:43.160 --> 33:44.000
Here. Take a look.

33:51.160 --> 33:53.360
What do you think? Do you like it?

33:55.440 --> 33:56.680
If you don't,

33:56.760 --> 33:57.960
I'll tell Madam Ji at once,

33:58.600 --> 34:00.240
so she can move you to a bigger courtyard.

34:01.200 --> 34:02.800
Thank you, Ms. Sun.

34:02.880 --> 34:06.360
Although the yard is run-down and messy,

34:06.440 --> 34:08.360
it'll be nice once it's all cleaned up.

34:08.920 --> 34:10.040
I'll get going then.

34:10.120 --> 34:11.120
All right.

34:16.960 --> 34:17.800
My lady.

34:17.880 --> 34:20.000
We just arrived
and this is the courtyard they gave us.

34:20.480 --> 34:22.120
You can report this to his lordship

34:22.199 --> 34:24.320
to punish Ms. Sun
for her dereliction of duty.

34:31.840 --> 34:34.199
If we don't like it,
we can move to another courtyard.

34:34.280 --> 34:36.880
If we report her but don't want to move,

34:37.840 --> 34:38.800
isn't that unreasonable?

34:38.880 --> 34:40.440
What if we move to another courtyard?

34:41.360 --> 34:43.239
Then it'll confirm that we're picky

34:43.320 --> 34:44.840
as soon as we got home.

34:44.920 --> 34:46.360
No wonder.

34:47.239 --> 34:49.920
Ji Shuran must have asked someone
to take Jiang Bingji there too.

34:50.480 --> 34:53.000
I was curious why she was so kind
to let you meet Old Madam.

34:53.679 --> 34:54.960
So it was a part of her plan.

34:55.880 --> 34:59.400
Old Madam is sincere towards Jiang Li.

34:59.480 --> 35:02.520
But she didn't stand up for you just now.

35:03.720 --> 35:07.240
This courtyard is just
an initial show of power.

35:08.680 --> 35:10.160
More will be coming.

35:23.600 --> 35:25.440
I always fell sick when I was young.

35:26.680 --> 35:28.840
Madam Ye and her ladyship
took care of me back then.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.760
They refused to let me do anything

35:33.360 --> 35:34.600
until I recovered.

35:38.880 --> 35:41.800
Her ladyship and Madam Ye
were great people.

35:43.200 --> 35:44.840
But after Madam Ye passed away,

35:45.880 --> 35:48.200
they tortured her ladyship so much.

35:49.440 --> 35:51.160
The Jiang family
can never repay her ladyship

35:51.640 --> 35:52.760
what they owe.

36:11.040 --> 36:12.040
Tong'er.

36:12.760 --> 36:17.200
I'll take back everything
that belongs to Jiang Li.

36:26.440 --> 36:27.520
SIMPLE AND ELEGANT

36:27.600 --> 36:28.440
Madam Ji.

36:29.240 --> 36:31.360
I already brought Jiang Li
to Fangfei Courtyard.

36:32.320 --> 36:34.000
Is there anything that seems strange?

36:34.560 --> 36:35.680
Ever since we took her back

36:35.760 --> 36:37.200
from the Duke Mansion,

36:37.280 --> 36:38.520
she started scheming against us.

36:39.160 --> 36:42.120
All sorts of lying, acting pitiful,
and pretending to be good.

36:42.200 --> 36:44.960
If you didn't make plans beforehand,

36:45.040 --> 36:47.160
we would've lost this first round.

36:47.240 --> 36:48.600
She's intelligent.

36:49.440 --> 36:51.480
When Old Madam asked her
if she received her gifts,

36:52.640 --> 36:54.400
she didn't reveal the truth.

36:54.480 --> 36:56.840
She's good at bidding her time.

37:01.640 --> 37:02.640
What's wrong?

37:02.720 --> 37:03.680
Madam Ji.

37:03.760 --> 37:05.800
Don't you think that this Jiang Li

37:05.880 --> 37:09.080
is too different from ten years ago?

37:12.320 --> 37:14.120
Are you talking about her temperament

37:14.760 --> 37:16.280
or her looks?

37:16.360 --> 37:18.440
Jiang Li was very young when she left.

37:18.520 --> 37:21.000
She looks somewhat similar to her.

37:21.720 --> 37:22.960
But her temperament

37:23.760 --> 37:25.960
has totally changed.

37:26.040 --> 37:27.320
Be careful with your words.

37:29.960 --> 37:31.840
SIMPLE AND ELEGANT

37:31.920 --> 37:33.240
Don't say things like that

37:34.280 --> 37:37.240
in front of his lordship and Old Madam.

37:37.320 --> 37:39.040
If word gets out,

37:39.600 --> 37:41.840
people will think that I'm not willing

37:42.360 --> 37:45.040
to acknowledge
the Jiang family's legitimate daughter.

37:45.120 --> 37:46.520
Since she dares to return,

37:47.320 --> 37:49.640
it means that she's fully prepared.

37:49.720 --> 37:51.640
If she's the real Jiang Li,

37:51.720 --> 37:53.880
I'll show her
who calls the shots in this place.

37:55.320 --> 37:56.960
If she's fake,

37:57.520 --> 37:59.120
she'll expose herself eventually

37:59.880 --> 38:02.920
under my watch.

38:03.000 --> 38:06.400
Then we'll find out what her motive is

38:06.480 --> 38:07.640
when the time comes.

38:09.560 --> 38:13.600
Send two maids to her tomorrow.

38:14.160 --> 38:15.040
Remember.

38:15.960 --> 38:17.600
They must serve her well.

38:32.560 --> 38:33.520
Ms. Jiang.

38:35.960 --> 38:36.800
Ms. Sun.

38:47.000 --> 38:49.440
They are Xiangqiao and Yunshuang.

38:49.520 --> 38:50.360
- My lady.
- My lady.

38:51.960 --> 38:53.600
Xiangqiao is…

38:53.680 --> 38:55.000
- What should I say?
- Clever and quick-witted.

38:55.080 --> 38:56.640
- Clever and quick-witted.
- Obedient and sensible.

38:56.720 --> 38:58.880
- Obedient and sensible.
- All right.

38:58.960 --> 39:01.080
Yunshuang is…

39:01.160 --> 39:02.360
Introduce yourself. Hurry.

39:02.440 --> 39:04.240
- Diligent.
- Diligent.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.280
Hard-working.

39:05.360 --> 39:08.600
Hard-working. All right.

39:08.680 --> 39:10.920
- My lady, you're so pretty.
- My lady, you're so pretty.

39:11.000 --> 39:12.760
Yes. She's beautiful.

39:12.840 --> 39:13.680
Both of them

39:13.760 --> 39:15.560
used to serve Madam Ji.

39:15.640 --> 39:16.480
But since you

39:16.560 --> 39:18.080
only have one maid with you,

39:18.160 --> 39:19.560
it's too constraining.

39:19.640 --> 39:20.600
So she told me

39:20.680 --> 39:23.040
to send them here to serve you.

39:23.120 --> 39:24.360
Please relay my thanks to Mother.

39:33.120 --> 39:34.720
My lady, look.

39:34.800 --> 39:35.920
These are the new clothes,

39:36.000 --> 39:38.120
new jewelry,

39:38.200 --> 39:39.440
and the monthly allowance

39:39.520 --> 39:40.800
that Madam Ji prepared for you.

39:40.880 --> 39:41.880
Please keep them well.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.760
Mother is so kind.

39:43.840 --> 39:44.760
Put them at the back.

39:49.480 --> 39:51.680
Xiangqiao, Yunshuang.

39:52.320 --> 39:54.360
Serve her ladyship well.

39:54.440 --> 39:56.520
With all your heart.

39:59.720 --> 40:01.880
I'll get going now.

40:02.440 --> 40:03.800
All right.

40:22.040 --> 40:22.960
Xiangqiao.

40:23.600 --> 40:25.280
Go and wash the cups.

40:25.360 --> 40:26.640
All right.

40:37.680 --> 40:39.960
How frightening! What should I do?

40:40.040 --> 40:41.360
I broke them.

40:41.880 --> 40:43.800
How could you break them?

40:43.880 --> 40:46.840
My hands are calloused and rough.

40:46.920 --> 40:48.520
I can only do some menial work.

40:48.600 --> 40:50.120
I still need some time

40:51.240 --> 40:52.680
to get used to delicate work.

40:53.760 --> 40:56.040
Although your hands
are calloused and rough,

40:56.120 --> 40:57.360
this is not skilled work.

40:57.440 --> 40:58.720
And you can't even do it.

40:58.800 --> 41:00.040
If I say that it's menial work,

41:00.120 --> 41:01.560
then it is.

41:01.640 --> 41:02.480
Menial.

41:02.560 --> 41:03.520
Tong'er.

41:05.680 --> 41:08.840
Xiangqiao's hands are calloused
and can only do menial work.

41:08.920 --> 41:11.920
Do this kind of skilled work
in the future.

41:15.000 --> 41:16.760
Then you'll sweep the floor from now on.

41:16.840 --> 41:18.320
The cups are broken.

41:18.400 --> 41:20.560
I need to go to the storehouse
to replace them.

41:25.640 --> 41:26.680
How could she be like that?

41:26.760 --> 41:28.000
She was bullying us on purpose.

41:28.640 --> 41:31.080
More things like this
will happen in the future.

41:36.880 --> 41:38.040
Yunshuang.

41:38.760 --> 41:39.840
Go and get some fertilizer.

41:40.480 --> 41:41.320
They don't have it.

41:41.880 --> 41:43.800
You haven't asked.
How do you know they don't have it?

41:44.360 --> 41:47.240
Hey, it's not something
that's readily available.

41:47.320 --> 41:48.680
No one is a foreseer,

41:48.760 --> 41:50.680
who knows we'd need some fertilizer today.

41:51.280 --> 41:53.440
We need to ask someone to come here

41:53.520 --> 41:55.280
and list out what we need, right?

41:55.360 --> 41:57.480
Then they'll send someone
to purchase them.

41:57.560 --> 41:58.520
Go and do that then.

41:58.600 --> 41:59.680
Now?

41:59.760 --> 42:00.760
I can't do that.

42:01.880 --> 42:03.760
The housekeepers
are definitely not in right now.

42:03.840 --> 42:05.520
If I just go there like this,

42:05.600 --> 42:07.000
I'll get 50 flogs.

42:07.080 --> 42:07.920
I won't go.

42:08.000 --> 42:10.000
How do you know she's not there
if you haven't asked?

42:10.680 --> 42:11.520
Forget it.

42:12.600 --> 42:15.000
Tong'er, go and ask them to come yourself.

42:15.600 --> 42:16.440
All right.

42:20.200 --> 42:21.240
My stomach is aching.

42:21.920 --> 42:23.440
I need to use the toilet.

42:35.280 --> 42:36.720
This is so sweet. Give it a taste.

42:38.360 --> 42:39.200
Is it sweet?

42:42.080 --> 42:43.240
It's so sweet.

42:43.760 --> 42:46.440
I want to see if you can keep
sitting there and doing nothing.

42:47.600 --> 42:48.680
Why can't we?

42:49.440 --> 42:50.760
Her ladyship said

42:50.840 --> 42:51.880
that we could take a rest

42:51.960 --> 42:53.640
whenever we are tired.

42:53.720 --> 42:54.640
Are you tired?

42:54.720 --> 42:56.080
I'm exhausted.

42:56.160 --> 42:57.440
- What about you?
- Same.

42:58.320 --> 42:59.720
Here. Eat this.

42:59.800 --> 43:00.800
Don't worry.

43:00.880 --> 43:02.520
I won't wash or touch the curtains

43:02.600 --> 43:04.120
in these two buckets.

43:04.200 --> 43:07.040
I'm going to show the Jiang family
how their maids are.

43:11.600 --> 43:12.440
I'll do it.

43:13.560 --> 43:15.440
My lady, how can you do this kind of work?

43:15.520 --> 43:17.720
I worked half a day too,
but I'm not complaining about being tired.

43:26.280 --> 43:27.360
She didn't throw a tantrum?

43:28.640 --> 43:29.560
How obedient.

43:30.160 --> 43:31.720
I also think that it's so strange.

43:32.280 --> 43:33.200
I even asked

43:33.280 --> 43:35.960
those two maids to bully her more.

43:36.520 --> 43:38.080
I never thought that her ladyship

43:38.600 --> 43:40.440
would be so accepting.

43:41.480 --> 43:42.520
Madam Ji.

43:42.600 --> 43:46.160
- Should we bully her even more?
- There's no need.

43:46.240 --> 43:47.960
Just ask people to continue watching her.

43:49.360 --> 43:51.840
Inform me at once if she does anything.

43:51.920 --> 43:53.280
It'll be Ruoyao's hairpin ceremony soon.

43:53.840 --> 43:56.160
I don't want to spend any energy on her.

43:57.720 --> 43:59.000
If she knows her place,

43:59.080 --> 44:00.720
I can tolerate her.

44:01.200 --> 44:03.080
But if she doesn't…

44:09.840 --> 44:13.000
GAZEBO

44:16.280 --> 44:17.280
Miss.

44:17.360 --> 44:19.440
Look at them.
They don't act like maids at all.

44:23.720 --> 44:25.920
Miss, you are Ms. Jiang now.

44:26.000 --> 44:27.480
You can punish them.

44:28.080 --> 44:28.920
Are you done?

44:29.880 --> 44:31.000
Also…

44:31.480 --> 44:32.360
They are the ones

44:32.440 --> 44:33.600
who cause trouble every time,

44:33.680 --> 44:35.320
But I must clean up their mess.

44:37.160 --> 44:38.000
Are you mad?

44:38.920 --> 44:40.560
Of course.

44:40.640 --> 44:42.680
I just think they haven't been here long,

44:42.760 --> 44:44.280
but they're already bullying us.

44:44.360 --> 44:45.760
What should we do in the future?

44:46.360 --> 44:47.360
We're new here.

44:48.080 --> 44:50.360
If I order the maids around

44:50.920 --> 44:52.920
and punish them severely,

44:53.520 --> 44:55.640
what would Old Madam Jiang
and Jiang Yuanbai think of me

44:55.720 --> 44:56.720
if they hear about it?

44:58.160 --> 44:59.360
Are you saying that…

44:59.440 --> 45:00.320
Think about it.

45:01.080 --> 45:04.000
These two maids worked fine
for the family before this.

45:04.080 --> 45:06.760
Why have they done badly
in Fangfei Courtyard?

45:07.880 --> 45:09.360
Wouldn't that make me look bossy?

45:10.360 --> 45:13.000
Once I'm labeled as bossy,

45:14.280 --> 45:16.240
the guilt that
Jiang Yuanbai feels toward Li'er

45:17.080 --> 45:19.640
for letting her suffer
ten years on the mountain

45:20.200 --> 45:22.240
will be erased by Ji Shuran easily.

45:23.040 --> 45:25.400
But miss,
we can't keep backing down, right?

45:26.880 --> 45:29.800
I'm enduring it because
I don't want to expose myself.

45:30.920 --> 45:32.480
But you are an honest person.

45:33.040 --> 45:34.680
So it confuses them.

45:36.000 --> 45:36.840
Miss,

45:36.920 --> 45:39.040
have you come up
with a solution against them?

45:40.680 --> 45:42.520
After they work for me
for the past two days,

45:42.600 --> 45:44.720
I've already figured them out.

45:45.280 --> 45:46.880
We've given them plenty of chances.

45:50.960 --> 45:52.320
- Here. Lend a hand.
- Be careful.

45:52.840 --> 45:53.880
Let's go.

45:55.240 --> 45:57.000
- Be careful.
- Where should I put it?

45:57.080 --> 45:58.200
- Over here.
- All right.

45:59.920 --> 46:00.960
- Watch the steps.
- Be careful.

46:02.200 --> 46:03.200
Here.

46:04.440 --> 46:05.320
Put it in front.

46:06.640 --> 46:07.480
Put it here.

46:09.120 --> 46:10.480
- There.
- All right. I'll go ahead.

46:10.560 --> 46:11.520
Take this.

46:12.600 --> 46:13.760
- Be careful.
- What is this for?

46:14.920 --> 46:17.040
My lord, these are arranged by Madam Ji.

46:17.120 --> 46:19.440
Isn't it Ms. Ruoyao's
hairpin ceremony soon?

46:23.760 --> 46:24.960
Put one here.

46:27.320 --> 46:28.240
My dear.

46:28.720 --> 46:30.280
On my way here,

46:30.360 --> 46:32.800
I can see that the residence
is being decorated.

46:32.880 --> 46:34.760
You have worked hard.

46:34.840 --> 46:36.080
It's my duty.

46:38.600 --> 46:40.960
This is the guest list
for the hairpin ceremony.

46:41.760 --> 46:42.840
Please take a look at it.

46:44.680 --> 46:46.640
I'll leave it to you to make the decision.

46:50.320 --> 46:51.280
What's wrong?

46:53.360 --> 46:55.280
This is a major ceremony for Ruoyao.

46:55.360 --> 46:57.760
We have to invite the Marquis of Ningyuan.

47:10.360 --> 47:11.440
I'm not worried

47:11.520 --> 47:13.360
about the Marquis of Ningyuan
feeling offended.

47:13.440 --> 47:15.560
After all, Li'er is our child.

47:15.640 --> 47:17.160
She'll meet the public sooner or later.

47:17.240 --> 47:18.800
I'm just afraid she'll feel ill at ease.

47:19.600 --> 47:23.520
She was engaged to Zhou Yanbang
from the Marquis' Mansion.

47:23.600 --> 47:25.400
But due to the mistake that she made,

47:25.480 --> 47:28.280
we discussed with the marquis
that Ruoyao should take her place.

47:28.360 --> 47:31.880
If Li'er sees Ruoyao and Yanbang together,

47:31.960 --> 47:33.640
I'm afraid she won't feel at ease.

47:33.720 --> 47:35.160
Moreover,

47:35.240 --> 47:36.680
we are a prestigious family.

47:36.760 --> 47:38.280
There'll be many officials

47:38.360 --> 47:40.000
attending Ruoyao's hairpin ceremony.

47:40.880 --> 47:42.080
If Li'er is around

47:42.160 --> 47:44.960
and the incident with Old Madam
that day repeats itself,

47:45.040 --> 47:46.360
it'll be bad for her.

47:52.640 --> 47:54.240
You have a point.

47:55.640 --> 47:57.760
If she can't handle
the situation properly,

47:57.840 --> 47:59.400
she'll be criticized.

48:00.520 --> 48:02.920
We won't let Li'er attend
the hairpin ceremony.

48:03.000 --> 48:05.920
Let her get used to living
in the capital city first.

48:06.520 --> 48:09.600
Then, we'll find a chance
to introduce her to the public.

48:10.360 --> 48:11.760
Your wish is my command.

48:13.080 --> 48:14.680
You've worked hard lately.

48:14.760 --> 48:15.880
Let me give you a massage.

48:30.280 --> 48:33.360
JIANG RESIDENCE

48:44.240 --> 48:45.080
Xiangqiao.

48:46.080 --> 48:46.920
Come.

48:52.640 --> 48:54.280
Only Xiangqiao is called.

48:58.040 --> 48:59.560
Go. It's fine.

49:00.840 --> 49:02.880
Xiangqiao, have a seat.

49:07.600 --> 49:08.440
Tong'er.

49:11.040 --> 49:11.920
Pour some tea for her.

49:15.800 --> 49:16.640
My lady.

49:16.720 --> 49:18.240
You are too kind.

49:18.320 --> 49:19.880
You just have to give me your order.

49:21.200 --> 49:22.040
I have

49:22.120 --> 49:23.520
already lectured Tong'er.

49:23.600 --> 49:26.080
She grew up at Zhennv Hall with me
since she was a kid,

49:27.560 --> 49:28.760
so she doesn't know the rules

49:28.840 --> 49:30.240
and she doesn't know
the ways of the world.

49:30.840 --> 49:32.480
She's a straightforward person.

49:32.560 --> 49:33.480
Please don't blame her.

49:35.240 --> 49:36.280
You're being too serious.

49:37.000 --> 49:40.160
We just want to serve you well.

49:42.280 --> 49:44.120
We lived at Zhennv Hall for so many years.

49:44.200 --> 49:45.160
We've just returned

49:45.240 --> 49:47.560
and there are many rules
that we don't know.

49:48.280 --> 49:51.640
I hope that you can give us
some guidance after this.

49:53.840 --> 49:54.680
This…

49:58.080 --> 49:59.040
My lady.

50:01.120 --> 50:03.320
This is what Mother gave me
when I just came back.

50:05.080 --> 50:06.960
I have nowhere to wear it.

50:07.440 --> 50:09.160
Do you like it?

50:13.400 --> 50:14.240
Well…

50:14.800 --> 50:16.120
If you like it,

50:16.680 --> 50:17.600
you can have it.

50:18.760 --> 50:19.600
Thank you, my lady.

50:21.480 --> 50:23.160
I have something else to ask you.

50:24.120 --> 50:25.760
What is it, my lady?

50:26.520 --> 50:28.680
I saw many servants moving

50:28.760 --> 50:30.320
some potted plants outside.

50:30.400 --> 50:31.680
This place is bustling.

50:32.280 --> 50:34.440
Are we going to have
some important guests over?

50:34.520 --> 50:36.680
Ms. Ruoyao's hairpin ceremony
is in a few days.

50:36.760 --> 50:38.360
Everyone is getting ready for it.

50:40.880 --> 50:42.040
I see.

50:43.080 --> 50:43.920
Give me more tea.

50:45.920 --> 50:46.760
Here.

50:48.360 --> 50:50.920
I can't visit Grandmother these days

50:51.760 --> 50:53.400
since I'm afraid she'll get upset.

50:53.960 --> 50:56.160
But I'm a bit bored here.

50:56.760 --> 50:59.320
My courtyard looks nice,

50:59.400 --> 51:00.760
but it's a little bit empty.

51:00.840 --> 51:02.960
Can you get me

51:03.040 --> 51:05.120
some potted plants
from the housekeeper to decorate it?

51:06.240 --> 51:08.680
Although I can't help
with my sister's ceremony,

51:08.760 --> 51:11.240
I want to make
my living quarters look livelier.

51:12.760 --> 51:13.600
My lady.

51:14.200 --> 51:15.120
Well…

51:15.720 --> 51:16.560
I…

51:20.840 --> 51:22.560
I know the rules of the residence.

51:23.520 --> 51:25.560
If you can help me with this,

51:25.640 --> 51:27.080
other than this hairpin,

51:27.680 --> 51:29.520
more will be coming.

51:32.000 --> 51:34.200
Just leave this trivial thing to me.

51:35.600 --> 51:36.480
What a traitorous

51:37.120 --> 51:38.760
and shameless woman.

51:39.640 --> 51:40.680
Thank you, my lady.

51:47.440 --> 51:49.880
My lady, you are too generous.

51:51.120 --> 51:53.040
The more they get from me, the better.

51:56.520 --> 51:57.800
At this point,

51:57.880 --> 51:59.680
we still don't know
about the hairpin ceremony.

52:00.840 --> 52:02.480
I guess they don't want me to attend.

52:03.640 --> 52:06.000
Ji Shuran has a great plan instead.

52:06.080 --> 52:08.480
She doesn't want me
to get close to the Jiang family.

52:09.040 --> 52:10.920
And she doesn't want the public to see me.

52:12.720 --> 52:15.320
If I let her hide me in the dark,

52:15.800 --> 52:18.280
it'll be pointless for me
to return to the Jiang family.

52:18.840 --> 52:21.560
I'll always be the Jiang Li
who's surrounded by rumors.

52:22.360 --> 52:25.400
So I have to attend this hairpin ceremony.

52:27.760 --> 52:29.920
I want to let everyone
in the capital city knows

52:30.920 --> 52:34.120
that Jiang Li is the eldest
legitimate daughter of the Jiang family.
